# Razor Rosaria Fischl Xianyun. ~18s Rot. Razor Phys Plunge. Razor uses skill off CD while plunging. OHC > SoDP Xianyun, but bubbles may miss. Razor uses burst when ready just to fill rotation time. 50% Collisions. 

# Team - Options listsed by DPS
razor char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
razor add weapon="serpent" refine=1 lvl=90/90 +params=[stacks=5];
